v<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>p className<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"paragraph\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>There are many variations <span class=\"token keyword\">of</span> passages <span class=\"token keyword\">of</span> Lorem Ipsum available<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> but the majority have suffered alteration <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> some form<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> by injected humour<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> or randomised words which don't look even slightly believable<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>p<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n       \n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>p className<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"paragraph\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>There are many variations <span class=\"token keyword\">of</span> passages <span class=\"token keyword\">of</span> Lorem Ipsum available<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> but the majority have suffered alteration <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> some form<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> by injected humour<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> or randomised words which don't look even slightly believable<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>p<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>p className<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"paragraph\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>There are many variations <span class=\"token keyword\">of</span> passages <span class=\"token keyword\">of</span> Lorem Ipsum available<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> but the majority have suffered alteration <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> some form<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> by injected humour<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> or randomised words which don't look even slightly believable<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>p<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> App<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">App.css</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre class=\"language-css\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token selector\">.paragraph</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">margin-bottom</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 20px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">line-height</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 1.8<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>In the above code example, I have used the <code class=\"language-text\">line-height: 1.8;</code> to change paragraph spacing in react js.</p>\n<p>Check the output of the above code.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/10ba36c825b1315f8b41ec501bea793b/ec897/paragraph-spacing.webp\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\